=== [1/2] rust 2024 edition
Answer: The Rust 2024 edition shipped with Rust 1.85.

1. Rust 2024 edition
https://example.com/rust-2024
The Rust 2024 edition is the largest edition yet. It changes how impl Trait captures lifetimes, reserves the gen keyword, and makes unsafe extern blocks explicit.

2. Editions explained
https://blog.example.org/editions
Editions let Rust evolve without breaking existing code.

